   <crs:Description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Glowing desert sunsets with rich orange rock and soft purple shadows. White balance: Start from As Shot, then warm it: Temp +300 to +500 K (RAW) or +8 on the slider (JPEG). Tint +5.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
